{"articleNo":"188982","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=188982&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"신입학생 및 편입학생 원스톱서비스 학적부 사진 등재 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.02.27","hit":"4642","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></span></span></span></font></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">원스톱서비스 내 학적부 사진 등재 안내</span></span></span></strong></span></font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></span></strong></span></font></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span></font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">우리대학에 입학한 모든 학생은 입학 후 원스톱서비스에 사진을 등록하여야</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">휴학 및 복학 신청, 성적열람&nbsp;등이 가능하오니</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u>사진이 등록되어 있지 않은 학생들은 빠른 시일 내에 학적부 사진을 등록</u>하여 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">불이익을 받는 일이 없도록 하시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 등록방법</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong>원스톱서비스 - 학적부 - 기재사항변경 - 사진찾기(JPEG 사진불러오기) - 사진저장&nbsp; </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
